  era: "c. 2600\u20131900 BCE \xB7 Section 2 \xB7 Indus Valley Civilisation \xB7 c. 3300 \u2013 1300 BCE (mature phase c. 2600 \u2013 1900 BCE)"
  title: The Indus script
  text: The Indus script appears on seals, tablets and pottery, with about 400 signs, mostly in very short inscriptions. It was probably written from right to left. Despite many attempts, it has not yet been deciphered.
